  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bridging the gap on Syrian refugee return</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected effects for the target group of the Activity (outcome) are: 1. Prmotion of a shared understanding among key stakeholders of the requirements for an internationally supported process of returns to Syria, and what more remains to be done. 1. Produce agreement with those stakeholders on practicable, responsible revisions to Lebanon&apos;s refugee policy framework. 3) Additioonally use findings to inform Lebanese public discourse on refugees, refugee return and international donor support to Lebanon. 

The planned main outputs are the following: 
-2 policy reports: the requirement of Internationally Supported Return, and the Reality of Return from Lebanon. 
-4 companion articles
-1 Beirut workshop
In-person meetings with key Lebanese policy stakeholders to present the report findings</narrative>
  </description>
